# Darkweb Monitoring Platform

Platform internal Threat Intelligence berbasis Python untuk memantau kebocoran data (*credential leak*, *stealer logs*, dan *email footprint*) secara realtime.

---

## Dokumentasi Visual & Screenshots
Semua tangkapan layar UI, diagram arsitektur, dan aset gambar pendukung tersimpan di folder berikut:
[Lihat Folder Dokumentasi & Assets (`/docs`)](./docs/)


## Tech Stack & Service Components

| Component | Technology | Description |
|---|---|---|
| **API Core** | FastAPI | Gateway API endpoint & scanner pipeline controller |
| **Task Queue** | Celery + Redis | Worker engine untuk eksekusi job scraping asinkron |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL (Docker) | Relational storage (Port 5433) dengan ORM SQLAlchemy & UUID |
| **Dashboard** | Streamlit | Interface monitoring internal SOC |
| **CTI Modules** | HudsonRock, Holehe, BreachDirectory | Integration engine untuk *live-data* kebocoran & OSINT |

---

## Environment Variables Setup

Pastikan file `.env` sudah tersedia di folder root project dengan variabel berikut sebelum menyalakan service:

```env
POSTGRES_USER=postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=postgres
POSTGRES_DB=cti_db
POSTGRES_PORT=5433
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
RAPIDAPI_KEY=isi_jika_ingin_menggunakan

Urutan Execution
Penting: Docker Desktop harus dalam keadaan aktif (status engine running berwarna hijau di taskbar) sebelum masuk ke langkah nomor 2 yaa

1. Nyalakan Base Infrastructure (Database & Redis)
PowerShell
docker compose up -d
Verifikasi container: Jalankan docker ps dan pastikan PostgreSQL (Port 5433) serta Redis berstatus Up.

2. Nyalakan API Engine (Terminal 1)
PowerShell
.\env\Scripts\Activate.ps1
python main.py --api

3. Nyalakan Celery Worker (Terminal 2)
PowerShell
.\env\Scripts\Activate.ps1
celery -A tasks worker --loglevel=info -P solo

4. Nyalakan Streamlit Dashboard (Terminal 3)
PowerShell
.\env\Scripts\Activate.ps1
streamlit run dashboard.py


🗂️ Directory Structure
├── scrapers/
│   ├── breach_service.py      # Integration module RapidAPI BreachDirectory
│   ├── hudsonrock_service.py  # HudsonRock Cavalier API (Infostealer logs)
│   └── holehe_service.py      # Holehe OSINT footprint engine
├── docs/                      # Screenshots UI, diagram, dan aset visual
├── models.py                  # Database schema (SQLAlchemy + UUID)
├── database.py                # Database connection & session setup
├── tasks.py                   # Celery task definitions
├── main.py                    # FastAPI app & core pipeline logic
├── dashboard.py               # Frontend Streamlit UI
└── docker-compose.yml         # Base infrastructure (Postgres:5433 & Redis)


⚠️ Known Troubleshooting & Notes
Error psycopg2.OperationalError: Connection refused (Port 5433)
Penyebab: Celery mengeksekusi koneksi DB sebelum container PostgreSQL siap, atau Docker Desktop di Windows mengalami hang.

Solusi:
Restart Docker Desktop.
Jika Docker stuck, buka PowerShell Administrator dan jalankan wsl --shutdown. Buka kembali Docker Desktop, jalankan docker compose up -d, pastikan container statusnya up, baru jalankan Celery.

Live Data Engine
Seluruh modul scraper sudah menggunakan data riil (tanpa mock data):
HudsonRock: Penarikan log perangkat terinfeksi malware (Lumma, RedLine, Vidar) berdasarkan target email.
Holehe: Pengecekan registrasi email secara real-time di 120+ platform.
BreachDirectory: Kueri langsung via RapidAPI endpoint.